From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:34:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add net::ConnectionParker: one poll thread for
 connections awaiting input

Holds new and kept-alive connections until they are readable, then hands
them out under a global cap (the pool size) and a per-client cap, with an
RAII ActiveShare per dispatched connection. Deadlines are enforced on the
parker thread; stop closes everything parked at once. The thread starts
only in start() (ADR-0082). Part of HTTP-1 (ADR-0077).

